# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Download Python and use a virtual environment with Qiskit (recommended).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pobierz Pythona i użyj środowiska wirtualnego razem z Qiskit (zalecane).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
